WEBVTT

00:00.870 --> 00:06.080
♪Pierce through the world That laugh at ideas♪

00:18.180 --> 00:22.770
♪We've arrived today carrying Something that is unnamed♪

00:22.810 --> 00:27.810
♪All of it cannot be Described by mere words♪

00:27.810 --> 00:31.780
♪We cannot accept that Tomorrow is the future♪

00:32.490 --> 00:36.530
♪For we do not have a way to Somehow put it into shape♪

00:36.530 --> 00:41.370
♪Gather the pieces of the broken heart♪

00:41.370 --> 00:45.870
♪And take back our voices♪

00:46.080 --> 00:49.550
♪Never let go of this hand you've grasped♪

00:49.550 --> 00:51.840
♪Because it's on the verge of disappearing♪

00:51.840 --> 00:55.630
♪Aah, please remain the way you are♪

00:55.630 --> 00:58.970
♪Even if the times is Accelerated by cruelty♪

00:58.970 --> 01:01.640
♪Even if your dream is disappearing♪

01:01.640 --> 01:04.980
♪Never give up the beat of your heart♪

01:04.980 --> 01:09.770
♪With the independence we've finally
Gained after falling many times♪

01:09.770 --> 01:14.990
♪Pierce through the world That laugh at ideas♪

01:30.960 --> 01:33.760
The Ebon Blacksmith, huh?

01:33.760 --> 01:37.470
However, High Humans are
already extinct in this world.

01:37.470 --> 01:41.100
Indeed. That's why I can't back that up.

01:41.100 --> 01:43.930
But it's clear there is
an extraordinary person

01:43.930 --> 01:46.810
who can treat weapons
at this level as disposable.

01:46.810 --> 01:51.690
Gadras, isn't the Ebon Blacksmith
the proprietor of the Moon Sanctum?

01:51.690 --> 01:53.150
Correct.

01:53.150 --> 01:55.280
Let's ask after we're back
to the Kingdom.

01:55.280 --> 01:56.570
Here's a question.

01:56.570 --> 02:00.160
What if a High Human
has really returned?

02:00.160 --> 02:04.290
If so, then I want to have
a game of fight with him.

02:04.790 --> 02:07.210
I don't mind marrying him, either.

02:07.210 --> 02:09.170
I say this just in case,

02:09.170 --> 02:13.050
but don't think of suddenly slashing him
in the name of a game, okay?

02:13.420 --> 02:15.800
I'm not that unreasonable.

02:20.340 --> 02:23.680
So, give me your explanation now.

02:23.680 --> 02:26.520
Why are you suddenly
so confrontational?

02:26.520 --> 02:31.690
You came with Schnee Raizar who
never bows, kneels, or yields to anyone.

02:31.690 --> 02:34.190
It's been a long time, Wilhelm.

02:34.940 --> 02:36.690
What the heck happened?

02:36.690 --> 02:40.700
In short, Schnee defeated the Lord...

02:40.700 --> 02:42.660
Hey! That's dangerous!

02:42.660 --> 02:45.330
You exerted unbelievable magic,

02:45.330 --> 02:47.790
stop acting like you did nothing!

02:47.790 --> 02:49.960
You must have wreaked havoc back there!

02:49.960 --> 02:51.710
How did you know?!

02:51.960 --> 02:53.460
Of course I know!

02:53.460 --> 02:55.960
You did that flashy stunt

02:55.960 --> 02:57.710
and caught up to us right away,

02:57.710 --> 02:59.630
yet you expect me to be fooled?!

02:59.630 --> 03:02.890
Wait, wait! Calm down!
Don't use Venom!

03:02.890 --> 03:06.890
Tch. Stop fooling around
and explain everything already.

03:10.770 --> 03:12.770
So you're a High Human.

03:12.770 --> 03:14.770
He's my Master as well.

03:14.770 --> 03:16.440
To put it simply, yes.

03:16.440 --> 03:17.980
That isn't simple.

03:17.980 --> 03:20.780
But that explains your magic power.

03:20.780 --> 03:23.160
Sorry, I still held back that time.

03:23.160 --> 03:26.910
Oh, really?! Master of Schnee Raizar?!

03:27.910 --> 03:29.500
High Human.

03:29.500 --> 03:32.370
Is there any record remaining about us?

03:32.370 --> 03:34.040
In a way.

03:34.040 --> 03:40.800
Only how you're absurdly strong and
have extreme skill in your specialties.

03:40.800 --> 03:43.720
Even now, you're being
treated like deities.

03:43.720 --> 03:47.560
Because the others have
their own stories as well.

03:48.520 --> 03:50.560
It seems things will get annoying.

03:51.180 --> 03:54.310
Well, I think I won't lose
in blacksmithing, though.

03:54.310 --> 03:56.940
What? Are you a blacksmith?

03:56.940 --> 03:57.860
Yeah.

03:57.860 --> 04:00.280
Do you want me to reforge
Venom for you?

04:00.280 --> 04:01.320
Don't you dare!

04:01.320 --> 04:03.570
If you want to add
anything, just holler.

04:03.570 --> 04:05.950
I'll even do it at
a cheaper price for you.

04:05.950 --> 04:09.830
How could I trust you when
you talk like a shady merchant?

04:09.830 --> 04:13.040
Well, it's just my blacksmith
blood getting to me.

04:14.920 --> 04:17.000
Huh? Mr. Shin?

04:17.000 --> 04:17.710
Hey!

04:17.710 --> 04:19.710
Ah, hello.

04:19.710 --> 04:23.090
W-Why are you here?!
Are you all right?!

04:23.090 --> 04:25.180
We managed it somehow.

04:25.180 --> 04:26.640
"Somehow managed"?

04:26.640 --> 04:28.890
Eh? And who might you be?

04:28.890 --> 04:31.480
Nice to meet you. I am Schnee Raizar.

04:31.480 --> 04:34.100
Ah, thank you for being so polite...

04:35.400 --> 04:37.690
Um... What did she say just now?

04:37.690 --> 04:40.730
Schnee Raizar. You know her well.

04:40.730 --> 04:42.940
She's that Schnee Raizar.

04:42.940 --> 04:45.820
- "That?"
- Yeah, "that" one.

04:46.320 --> 04:47.570
What?!

04:49.910 --> 04:52.500
She's real!

04:52.500 --> 04:52.930
Ugh, I feel like puking.

04:52.930 --> 04:53.850
(Urp)
Ugh, I feel like puking.

04:53.850 --> 04:55.500
Ugh, I feel like puking.

04:55.500 --> 04:58.960
Probably motion sickness
from moving faster than horses.

04:58.960 --> 05:01.250
- Sorry, Rashia.
- It's fine.

05:01.250 --> 05:04.760
Just to make sure, we separate
in front of the gate, right?

05:04.760 --> 05:06.430
I don't mind.

05:06.430 --> 05:09.010
The request is to obtain the skill.

05:09.640 --> 05:11.970
Even if anything happens
at the church,

05:11.970 --> 05:14.140
that would be our business.

05:14.140 --> 05:17.520
As always, despite your manner
of talking, you're very sensible.

05:17.520 --> 05:18.650
Shush that.

05:19.610 --> 05:21.020
Here, just in case.

05:23.400 --> 05:26.530
An item to send messages, huh?

05:26.530 --> 05:28.160
If anything happens, contact me.

05:29.570 --> 05:31.660
If I ever find myself using this,

05:31.660 --> 05:34.830
It would only be when I had no choice.

05:34.830 --> 05:37.790
If anything happens,
that means you'll get involved.

05:40.540 --> 05:43.210
He seems to not want
to get outsiders involved.

05:43.210 --> 05:46.680
I understand that sentiment,
however...

05:47.680 --> 05:49.140
Get me involved!

05:49.800 --> 05:54.060
I can't sleep well if I just do
nothing after getting this deep.

05:54.890 --> 05:56.430
- But...
- And moreover!

05:57.980 --> 06:04.030
I can't leave my first-ever friend here
and the children he tried to protect.

06:04.650 --> 06:06.190
What did you even say?

06:06.190 --> 06:09.410
Anyway, don't worry and
just call me, okay?!

06:09.410 --> 06:11.910
This gets embarrassing,
so take it already!

06:11.910 --> 06:13.700
I won't hesitate, you know.

06:13.700 --> 06:15.950
Yeah, count on me.

06:22.420 --> 06:25.060
You never change, Shin.

06:25.060 --> 06:26.090
Really?

06:27.260 --> 06:29.840
You are always like that.

06:30.510 --> 06:32.720
Without getting haughty
with your strength,

06:32.720 --> 06:35.970
you always indiscriminately
protect the weak.

06:35.970 --> 06:38.980
I've always watched you as
you do so, right beside you.

06:38.980 --> 06:41.520
Schnee, let's move on.

06:41.520 --> 06:42.980
Yes.

06:49.240 --> 06:51.620
(The Moon Sanctum)

06:52.710 --> 06:54.620
Oh, this smells great.

06:55.870 --> 06:58.040
Oh my, my tummy is rumbling!

06:58.040 --> 07:00.000
I am hungry.

07:00.000 --> 07:04.090
It's about the time as well,
let's have dinner.

07:04.090 --> 07:05.880
Master, welcome home!

07:05.880 --> 07:10.630
You see! Just as written on the card,
someone you know came...

07:10.630 --> 07:14.510
Calm yourself first.
You're overexcited.

07:14.510 --> 07:17.850
Huh? Why are you with Shin?

07:17.850 --> 07:19.020
Howdy.

07:19.600 --> 07:21.520
Well, things happened.

07:21.520 --> 07:23.480
Anyway, let's eat, shall we?

07:23.480 --> 07:26.360
It's a bit of a long talk, after all.

07:26.360 --> 07:27.690
I understand...

07:27.690 --> 07:30.030
But, is Shin eating together with us?

07:30.030 --> 07:31.820
Of course, he is.

07:31.820 --> 07:34.530
Eh? Why is it so?

07:35.330 --> 07:39.040
I remember I haven't told you about it.

07:39.040 --> 07:41.620
Shin is the proprietor
of the Moon Sanctum.

07:41.620 --> 07:42.540
I am.

07:43.330 --> 07:44.920
Proprietor...

07:44.920 --> 07:46.800
Ah, I see, the owner.

07:46.800 --> 07:49.670
Wait, owner?!

07:49.670 --> 07:51.300
Aren't you overreacting?

07:51.420 --> 07:53.640
How can I not be surprised?!

07:53.640 --> 07:57.680
If you're the owner, then you're
the legendary High Human!

07:57.680 --> 07:59.810
Wait, didn't I tell you before?

07:59.810 --> 08:03.060
No way anyone will
just accept that as the truth!

08:03.060 --> 08:06.820
But Master can't be wrong...

08:06.820 --> 08:08.320
That means...

08:08.320 --> 08:10.530
W-Without knowing you're the owner...

08:10.530 --> 08:12.570
- Please forgive my insolence!
- What?

08:13.150 --> 08:18.580
Oh yeah, that means she was being
so casual with her superior.

08:18.580 --> 08:21.710
Don't worry about it.
I understand your feelings.

08:21.710 --> 08:24.330
Huh? Yes, but...

08:24.330 --> 08:27.130
Come on, don't sweat it, really.

08:27.130 --> 08:29.500
Suddenly going formal doesn't feel right.

08:29.500 --> 08:32.340
- You won't kick me out of here?
- I won't.

08:32.340 --> 08:34.720
Anyway, with that settled!

08:34.720 --> 08:38.350
Ah, sorry for the late introduction,
but as the next surprise,

08:38.350 --> 08:41.310
this is Yuzuha, my Element Tail partner.

08:41.310 --> 08:43.100
I'm Yuzuha, and I'm hungry.

08:43.100 --> 08:45.850
Elemen... Wait, it speaks?!

08:48.060 --> 08:49.360
You're awesome, Schnee!

08:49.360 --> 08:51.230
All of them look so yummy!

08:52.610 --> 08:55.360
I've never seen these dishes before.

08:55.360 --> 08:58.370
- You're going all out, Master.
- Of course.

08:58.370 --> 09:00.830
It's totally worth getting
all the ingredients

09:00.830 --> 09:03.120
seeing how they
turn into amazing dishes.

09:03.120 --> 09:07.960
Hey, what kind of ingredients
did you serve?

09:07.960 --> 09:11.130
It feels like... Some kind of aura
is oozing out of the dish...

09:11.130 --> 09:14.590
Aura? I don't see it.

09:14.590 --> 09:16.630
Hmm, if I'm not mistaken...

09:16.630 --> 09:19.800
The meat is parts of Thermal Lion
and Orc King.

09:19.800 --> 09:22.470
The vegetables are Blood Radish
and Kalima Onions.

09:22.470 --> 09:25.060
The fruits are Ideya fruits
and Topaz pears.

09:25.060 --> 09:26.640
The others are just random.

09:26.640 --> 09:29.730
You also used the stuff
from the stockpile, right?

09:29.730 --> 09:35.150
Yes. It's a special occasion,
so I used the premium ingredients.

09:35.150 --> 09:35.900
Wait...

09:35.900 --> 09:40.660
That said, there was not enough time
to make more complicated stuff.

09:40.660 --> 09:43.450
Sounds like you haven't gone all out.

09:43.450 --> 09:46.500
- I'm expecting good things.
- Please do so.

09:46.500 --> 09:48.370
Wait a second here.

09:48.370 --> 09:49.830
What's up with that?!

09:49.830 --> 09:53.170
Most of them are impossible
to get premium ingredients!

09:53.170 --> 09:56.800
Or rather, normally no one
will think of cooking them!

09:56.800 --> 09:58.720
Eh, really?

09:58.720 --> 10:01.180
That aside, what aura is
she talking about, Schnee?

10:01.180 --> 10:02.310
That aside?!

10:02.310 --> 10:07.560
It's kind of like the remnants of the magic
and life force of the food ingredients.

10:07.560 --> 10:12.230
You can often see them from
strong monsters and rare plants.

10:12.230 --> 10:14.320
Huh, really?

10:14.320 --> 10:16.030
Are you even listening?

10:16.030 --> 10:17.740
Calm down, Tiera.

10:17.740 --> 10:19.740
Let's eat them while it's hot.

10:19.740 --> 10:22.080
- O-Okay...
- You're right.

10:22.080 --> 10:25.080
Then, let's dig in!

10:25.080 --> 10:26.450
- Let's dig in.
- Let's dig in.

10:26.450 --> 10:27.250
Dig in!

10:28.040 --> 10:30.330
You say let's dig in too, huh?

10:30.330 --> 10:32.840
Master said it, so I tagged along.

10:32.840 --> 10:35.840
For me, it's because Shin said it
so I naturally do so too.

10:35.840 --> 10:39.220
I see. That's quite interesting.

10:54.730 --> 10:55.610
(The Moon Sanctum)

10:55.610 --> 10:56.990
(The Moon Sanctum)
Huh...

10:56.990 --> 11:01.110
So the other support characters
are also living freely now.

11:01.110 --> 11:06.620
Believing that you're here somewhere
is the most wishful thinking.

11:07.450 --> 11:11.000
Everyone must have thought
it was not good to dwell on it.

11:11.000 --> 11:12.960
In my point of view, that's a relief.

11:12.960 --> 11:15.630
To keep searching for someone
who may not exist...

11:15.630 --> 11:18.210
I don't want to make you do that.

11:19.550 --> 11:24.010
If some do so, it is still their choice.

11:24.010 --> 11:26.720
It's nothing you should feel guilty over.

11:27.390 --> 11:29.520
I wonder about that.

11:29.520 --> 11:31.520
Shin, are you sad?

11:31.520 --> 11:33.400
Hmm? I'm okay.

11:33.400 --> 11:35.150
Oh, come on!

11:35.150 --> 11:38.150
You always worry too much, Shin.

11:38.150 --> 11:41.070
Tierra! You must be drunk.

11:44.700 --> 11:47.120
Master! There are two of you!

11:47.120 --> 11:50.830
She's totally out of it.
Is Tiera bad with alcohol?

11:50.830 --> 11:53.670
She didn't go this far last time.

11:53.670 --> 11:55.630
I'll let her rest.

11:55.630 --> 11:57.250
Yes, please.

11:57.250 --> 11:59.340
Come on, Tiera. Can you stand?

11:59.340 --> 12:01.470
I'm totally okay!

12:06.180 --> 12:08.640
Things remain as they are, huh?

12:08.640 --> 12:11.430
This place sure calms me like no other.

12:11.430 --> 12:12.190
Yuzuha?

12:12.190 --> 12:14.690
Oh, she's out already.

12:14.690 --> 12:15.940
I guess I will sleep too.

12:36.960 --> 12:38.590
Something's heavy.

12:38.590 --> 12:39.880
Yuzuha?

12:40.590 --> 12:42.670
Oh, she's there.

12:46.070 --> 12:47.930
Something's soft...

12:47.930 --> 12:50.970
So tender and warm...

12:51.470 --> 12:53.020
Smells nice...

12:54.690 --> 12:57.690
What?! Seriously?! What's happening?!

12:57.690 --> 13:00.690
This kind of thing really
happens in real life?!

13:00.690 --> 13:02.690
T-This is just...

13:02.690 --> 13:04.450
...really...

13:04.450 --> 13:06.160
...bad!

13:21.210 --> 13:22.210
Schnee...

13:22.210 --> 13:23.210
...ter...

13:26.840 --> 13:29.720
Mas... ter...

13:34.230 --> 13:38.440
I don't know what those
tears meant, but...

13:39.730 --> 13:41.690
I'm sorry, Schnee.

13:48.740 --> 13:49.870
It's so bright.

13:50.490 --> 13:51.490
Schnee...

13:51.490 --> 13:53.700
Ah, she's already awake.

13:56.460 --> 13:57.870
What's this silver hair?

14:00.690 --> 14:01.040
(Element Tail. Yuzuha, Level 411)

14:01.040 --> 14:02.210
(Element Tail. Yuzuha, Level 411)
Yuzuha?

14:02.210 --> 14:03.980
(Element Tail. Yuzuha, Level 411)

14:05.380 --> 14:08.050
Hey, wait up!

14:08.050 --> 14:09.840
That's loud.

14:09.840 --> 14:12.010
Oh, Shin! Good morning.

14:12.010 --> 14:14.020
Morning, my heavens!

14:14.020 --> 14:15.730
Wear something, will you?!

14:15.730 --> 14:16.770
But why?

14:16.770 --> 14:18.690
Just do it, I beg you!

14:19.910 --> 14:21.610
Shin, you're warm!

14:21.610 --> 14:25.320
If someone sees this,
my life is over.

14:26.990 --> 14:28.450
Just wear this for a while.

14:28.450 --> 14:29.820
What is this?

14:29.820 --> 14:31.700
I created it as a joke,

14:31.700 --> 14:34.200
but when the Element Tail
uses human bodies

14:34.200 --> 14:36.000
generally they all wear this.

14:37.330 --> 14:39.500
It has a size adjustment function.

14:39.500 --> 14:41.670
Tell me if you want another color.

14:41.670 --> 14:43.460
I like this one!

14:43.460 --> 14:45.050
Don't stand up!

14:45.050 --> 14:47.420
Shin!

14:47.420 --> 14:49.840
You should tell me if you can't wear it.

14:52.350 --> 14:53.890
Good morning.

14:55.100 --> 14:57.770
Yuzuha, you already turn
into human form.

14:57.770 --> 14:59.980
That is a wonderful red hakama.

14:59.980 --> 15:02.110
G-Good morning.

15:02.110 --> 15:04.940
Yes, good morning.

15:04.940 --> 15:07.940
Well then, I will prepare
one more chair by the table.

15:09.360 --> 15:11.070
- Thank you for the meal!
- Thank you for the meal!

15:11.070 --> 15:12.740
You're very welcome.

15:12.740 --> 15:13.870
(The Moon Sanctum)

15:13.910 --> 15:16.740
By the way, I want to ask
you something, Yuzuha.

15:16.740 --> 15:18.040
What is it?

15:18.040 --> 15:21.120
First of all, why were you at the shrine?

15:21.120 --> 15:27.380
You see, I was there because
it feels the least painful in there.

15:27.380 --> 15:31.220
Do you know anything about
that pattern on the floor?

15:31.220 --> 15:32.970
No, I don't know.

15:34.550 --> 15:39.270
I believe it slows down
the symptoms and provides relief...

15:39.270 --> 15:40.480
Second question.

15:40.480 --> 15:45.730
Do you know anything about 500 years ago
when many people disappeared?

15:45.730 --> 15:46.980
I don't know.

15:46.980 --> 15:49.360
People don't really come anyway.

15:50.320 --> 15:53.360
So, in the end,
what are you doing there?

15:53.360 --> 15:56.580
You see, I was only basking in the sun.

15:56.580 --> 15:59.500
And then suddenly
the ground went boom!

15:59.500 --> 16:01.500
And the wind went whoosh!

16:01.500 --> 16:03.750
The mountain went bam!

16:03.750 --> 16:05.880
That surprised me and I woke up.

16:05.880 --> 16:10.130
Then I did my best to keep
the ground from splitting open.

16:10.130 --> 16:14.430
Which means, the cataclysm occurred
and you tried to stop it?

16:14.430 --> 16:16.760
I think that sounds about right.

16:16.760 --> 16:21.230
Element Tail are monsters that
can use all magical attributes.

16:21.230 --> 16:25.650
They may be using some special technique
to prevent the cataclysm.

16:25.650 --> 16:28.440
While trying my hardest on it,
I suddenly felt pain

16:28.440 --> 16:30.030
so I rested at the shrine.

16:30.030 --> 16:34.660
The moment I thought I was about
to die, you came to save me!

16:34.660 --> 16:37.240
So that was really close.

16:37.240 --> 16:40.290
It's all thanks to Millie
that I managed to save you.

16:40.290 --> 16:43.920
- Let's say thank you to Millie again!
- You're right.

16:43.920 --> 16:46.080
Let's bring something for her.

16:46.080 --> 16:49.550
- Then, what about Kafalle?
- Kafalle?

16:49.550 --> 16:53.130
It's a baked sweet taught
in the elf village that Tiera makes.

16:53.130 --> 16:55.130
I put them on sale just because,

16:55.130 --> 16:57.760
but now it's our second
if not first best-selling goods.

16:57.760 --> 17:01.560
The Moon Sanctum is not supposed
to specialize in food, though.

17:01.560 --> 17:03.980
Even if we want to restock,

17:03.980 --> 17:07.150
you are the only one
who can open the armory.

17:07.150 --> 17:09.360
You're right, sorry!

17:09.360 --> 17:12.190
I'll forge some swords
for resupply later.

17:12.190 --> 17:13.440
Please.

17:15.320 --> 17:18.950
Sorry, but I have one more issue.

17:18.950 --> 17:20.740
What is it?

17:20.740 --> 17:24.830
There's actually someone I want
you to meet immediately.

17:24.830 --> 17:25.960
Who is it?

17:25.960 --> 17:27.000
Yes.

17:28.750 --> 17:29.840
It's Girart.

17:29.840 --> 17:31.750
Girart, huh?

17:33.090 --> 17:35.470
No, wait, is it really Girart?!

17:35.730 --> 17:36.380
(The Moon Sanctum)

17:36.880 --> 17:38.300
Is he still alive?

17:38.300 --> 17:40.600
The Sunset on Prosperity
was 500 years ago...

17:40.600 --> 17:44.930
Girart's life span as a High Beast
is 150 years at most, right?

17:44.930 --> 17:50.900
It's not like he is particularly dying,
but he probably won't last any longer.

17:50.900 --> 17:52.440
He's still...

17:52.440 --> 17:54.190
...waiting for you.

17:55.570 --> 17:57.200
He's waiting...

17:57.200 --> 17:59.740
You must know how
he gathered each beast tribe

17:59.740 --> 18:03.580
and formed
the Farnid Beast Alliance, right?

18:03.580 --> 18:06.960
Yes. He was called the first Beastking.

18:07.460 --> 18:09.790
The current king is the eighth.

18:09.790 --> 18:13.670
Of course, he's a skilled warrior
and a very capable ruler.

18:13.670 --> 18:16.970
I'm sure Girart is calmly
waiting for your return.

18:16.970 --> 18:19.340
Then, I must see him now!

18:19.340 --> 18:23.100
Just to make sure, but it's not
dangerous to go right away, right?

18:23.100 --> 18:24.220
Yes.

18:24.220 --> 18:25.890
Let's just go, then!

18:25.890 --> 18:28.440
I've many things to confirm too.

18:28.440 --> 18:30.940
Are you okay with leaving tomorrow?

18:30.940 --> 18:32.060
I am fine!

18:32.060 --> 18:34.610
Should I stay at the store as always?

18:34.610 --> 18:37.110
This time you're going with us.

18:37.240 --> 18:39.990
- I'm going too?!
- Since Shin has returned,

18:39.990 --> 18:42.620
we don't have to stick to
a certain place.

18:42.870 --> 18:46.250
Eh? But what will happen to the store?

18:46.250 --> 18:48.750
Ah, it's fine!
We'll bring it along anyway.

18:48.750 --> 18:50.500
Bring... along?

18:50.500 --> 18:52.630
Just don't worry about the store.

18:53.130 --> 18:56.260
Since you're finally able to go out,

18:56.260 --> 18:59.300
I think it'll be good to have
a journey together.

18:59.300 --> 19:00.380
What about it?

19:02.760 --> 19:05.770
If it's together with
both of you, I want to!

19:05.770 --> 19:08.390
- It's decided then.
- Everyone together!

19:08.390 --> 19:10.980
Then, let's get the preparation going.

19:10.980 --> 19:14.280
But it's only around gathering
food stock and equipment, anyway.

19:14.280 --> 19:19.490
I want to report back about
the Skullface to the kingdom.

19:19.490 --> 19:21.790
Let's split our work for now.

19:21.800 --> 19:22.530
Sure thing.

19:23.530 --> 19:26.790
I'll go to the guild after
making some swords.

19:26.790 --> 19:32.920
I think of taking some quests
near Farnid to level up my rank.

19:32.920 --> 19:35.210
Where should we meet up?

19:35.710 --> 19:37.420
I'll tell you by the message card.

19:37.420 --> 19:39.880
Then let's form a party.

19:39.880 --> 19:43.260
We can do voice chat
between us that way.

19:43.260 --> 19:44.470
Seriously?

19:44.470 --> 19:46.560
Now it is called telepathy.

19:47.430 --> 19:48.810
(System, Play Guide, Configuration)
(Party)

19:50.690 --> 19:51.810
All set.

19:51.810 --> 19:57.190
We should take this chance to register
Tiera as an adventurer as well.

19:57.190 --> 19:58.650
I understand.

19:58.650 --> 20:00.570
Let's go to the guild together.

20:01.700 --> 20:05.320
Then, I think I should change my outfit...

20:05.320 --> 20:08.580
- I'll wait at the forge.
- Yuzuha will go with you!

20:08.580 --> 20:10.710
Then I will go out first.

20:10.710 --> 20:12.580
See you, Master!

20:15.040 --> 20:16.710
Amazing!

20:16.710 --> 20:18.420
Is this the forge?

20:18.420 --> 20:21.510
You can watch,
but don't touch anything, 'kay?

20:21.510 --> 20:23.630
There are cursed weapons around, too.

20:24.470 --> 20:26.720
It seems I can use everything just fine.

20:26.720 --> 20:28.260
What will you do?

20:28.260 --> 20:29.720
I'll be forging some swords.

20:34.980 --> 20:37.860
I know where to hit somehow.

20:37.860 --> 20:39.480
That must be my skill in the work.

20:41.940 --> 20:43.490
First one is done.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.990
I overdid it.

20:47.530 --> 20:50.160
I unconsciously gave it
magic attachment,

20:50.160 --> 20:54.000
and its level is way over those
sold around the kingdom.

20:54.000 --> 20:55.250
You failed?

20:55.250 --> 20:57.420
Nah, it's not failed,

20:57.420 --> 20:59.750
but it didn't turn into
something we could sell.

21:00.420 --> 21:02.260
I kinda get the hang of it,

21:02.260 --> 21:04.760
the next one or the one after
should do it.

21:07.490 --> 21:10.600
With this many,
it should be okay for a while.

21:11.220 --> 21:14.520
Sorry I made you wait, Shin!

21:14.520 --> 21:18.230
I didn't think I would
take so long myself.

21:18.230 --> 21:21.900
It has been so long,
so I don't know what to wear.

21:21.900 --> 21:25.030
You're finally out after
100 years, after all.

21:26.860 --> 21:26.920
The outside feels so good!

21:26.920 --> 21:29.030
(The Moon Sanctum)
The outside feels so good!

21:29.030 --> 21:30.830
The weather is awesome too!

21:30.830 --> 21:32.540
Yeah, you're rig--!

21:32.540 --> 21:34.750
It's so refreshing!

21:37.920 --> 21:39.790
Now, let's go!

21:39.790 --> 21:41.000
You're right...

21:41.670 --> 21:43.960
What do you think of my breasts?

21:43.960 --> 21:45.800
Man, what a sight to be...

21:48.930 --> 21:51.010
Sheesh! Let's go!

21:51.010 --> 21:52.850
You'll be carrying the goods, got it?

21:52.850 --> 21:54.270
Are you serious?

21:56.770 --> 21:59.940
That's the punishment
for staring at a woman's chest!

21:59.940 --> 22:02.320
I'm very sorry.

22:16.160 --> 22:22.920
♪In the midst of the journey of
Neverending dreams♪

22:22.920 --> 22:28.430
♪I tried peeking
Through the yet-unseen future♪

22:28.430 --> 22:34.890
♪Whether the thing that lies
There is the smile of my friends♪

22:34.890 --> 22:41.150
♪Or is it despair and fury,
I've yet to know♪

22:41.150 --> 22:46.900
♪No matter how passionately
I wished for it♪

22:46.900 --> 22:52.160
♪I cannot return to the past♪

22:52.830 --> 22:58.500
♪So I will at least this hand mine now♪

22:58.500 --> 23:02.960
♪To build through the future♪

23:04.590 --> 23:10.510
♪In the lands so far away that
I will one day reach♪

23:10.510 --> 23:16.350
♪I'm sure there will be many
Great happiness waiting♪

23:16.350 --> 23:22.560
♪For all the smiles that always
Overflows this heart of mine♪

23:22.560 --> 23:28.150
♪I wish to protect them all,
So I aimed to the skies♪

23:28.150 --> 23:33.950
♪And build over an unwavering path♪

23:34.950 --> 23:39.940
(Next time, Episode 6: Escort Quest)
